### Financial Statement API - Test Cases
### Based on FMP API Documentation

### 1. Health Check
GET http://localhost:3000/health

###

### 2. Get Apple (AAPL) Financial Data - Default (1 annual period)
GET http://localhost:3000/financials?ticker=AAPL

###

### 3. Get Apple (AAPL) Financial Data - 5 Annual Periods
GET http://localhost:3000/financials?ticker=AAPL&limit=5&period=annual

###

### 4. Get Apple (AAPL) Quarterly Data - Last 4 Quarters
GET http://localhost:3000/financials?ticker=AAPL&limit=4&period=quarter

###

### 5. Get Apple (AAPL) - Specific Quarter (Q1)
GET http://localhost:3000/financials?ticker=AAPL&limit=1&period=Q1

###

### 6. Get Microsoft (MSFT) Financial Data - Annual
GET http://localhost:3000/financials?ticker=MSFT&limit=3&period=annual

###

### 7. Get Microsoft (MSFT) Financial Data - Quarterly
GET http://localhost:3000/financials?ticker=MSFT&limit=8&period=quarter

###

### 8. Get Tesla (TSLA) Financial Data
GET http://localhost:3000/financials?ticker=TSLA&limit=1

###

### 9. Get Google (GOOGL) Financial Data - 5 Years
GET http://localhost:3000/financials?ticker=GOOGL&limit=5

###

### 10. Get Amazon (AMZN) Financial Data - FY Period
GET http://localhost:3000/financials?ticker=AMZN&period=FY

###

### ERROR TEST CASES

### 11. Test Error - Missing Ticker
GET http://localhost:3000/financials

###

### 12. Test Error - Invalid Ticker
GET http://localhost:3000/financials?ticker=INVALID123456

###

### 13. Test Error - Invalid Limit (negative)
GET http://localhost:3000/financials?ticker=AAPL&limit=-1

###

### 14. Test Error - Limit Too High (max is 1000)
GET http://localhost:3000/financials?ticker=AAPL&limit=2000

###

### 15. Test Error - Invalid Period
GET http://localhost:3000/financials?ticker=AAPL&period=monthly

###

### 16. Test Error - Empty Ticker
GET http://localhost:3000/financials?ticker=

###
